  "description": {
   "en": "Irmhild, who has to hide her identity for a reason, is invited to attend a graduation party at the Royal Academy. There, she is suddenly accused of a crime she does not remember by the second prince, Eduard, but she brilliantly exposes the truth and reveals Eduard's guilt. However, this incident leads to the attention of the ‘thing’ in the royal court...?"
